  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The chatbox currently has the ability to omit sending notification sounds for certain messages through OSC, I would really love if it were a user facing option in the in-game keyboard. \n\nThere have been plenty of situations where I've sent messages and woken people up because of the ping noise, or attracted unwanted attention when wanting to say something to someone off to the side, among other circumstances. I would love if there were both a \"Send\" and \"Send silently\" button to avoid situations like this. Like I mentioned before, this is already a thing through OSC, so I assume this would be relatively simple to implement!\n\nJust to be super clear, I love the chatbox ping sound. I even wish it was on by default for everyone. I just want the ability to *sometimes* send quiet messages regardless of people's notification setting. \n\nThanks for your consideration! :]",
